# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/kharwar2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the initial MTP (i-MTP; 555 configurations of 15
# Materials Project Mo-S, Mo and S structures) and the augmented MTP
# (A-MTP; 703 configurations adding five grain-boundary structures with
# perturbations), QuantumATK PBE/LCAO references, and the geometry-
# optimization timings. Test errors are stated only as ranges over fitted
# realizations; structural, electronic and transport comparisons are
# properties.

